                   outro=T(r"**Answer:** (i) (Enter, Accommodate), payoffs (30, 50). (ii) Not credible: once the entrant is in, fighting earns 20 against 50. (iii) Yes: the capacity makes fighting the incumbent's best reply (45 > 10), which deters entry and earns 60 > 50.", r"**答案：** (i)（进入，接纳），收益 (30, 50)。(ii) 不可信：对方进来后，开打得 20，接纳得 50。(iii) 应该：产能让开打成为在位者的最优反应（45 > 10），阻止了进入，得 60 > 50。"),
